xnu: 0193 vince Pronto: try the pre-start PMU setups in turn

0192 (NV flag + Iris XO 48 MHz) stopped the firmware from creating its SMD
channels; without them it starts but HAL_START answers 38. Try Iris XO
48 MHz, Iris XO 19.2 MHz, NV flag alone, nothing; stop an attempt whose
WCNSS_CTRL does not appear in 5 s (PAS SHUTDOWN), log the firmware crash
reason (SMEM 422), reload, next. Boot-arg vinceiris=N tries only mode N.

